  "question": {
    "text": "Ozonolysis of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ClO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> produces an oxide of chlorine. The average oxidation state of chlorine in this oxide is ______ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Reaction :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ClO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>ClO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ClO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Here&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is oxidation state of chlorine in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ClO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p>"
  }
